{
  "uid": "arena64-data-pipeline",
  "title": "Arena64 \u2014 data pipeline",
  "description": "The outbox is the platform's delivery guarantee and, until A64-028.6, it emitted no metrics at all. Every failure it has ever had was found by reading a log file afterwards.",
  "tags": [
    "arena64"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Outbox backlog",
      "description": "Retryable and exhausted are counted separately: exhausted rows are not waiting for anything, and including them would make permanent loss look like a queue that might still drain.",
      "id": 1,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source) (arena64_outbox_backlog)",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Oldest unpublished entry",
      "description": "The number a count cannot give. A64-028.5A drained 1807 events to zero in 30 seconds under load; OutboxBacklogStale pages at fifteen minutes.",
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max(arena64_outbox_oldest_pending_age_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "oldest age",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Outbox throughput",
      "description": "",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(arena64_outbox_claimed_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "claimed/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(arena64_outbox_published_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "published/s",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(arena64_outbox_failed_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "failed {{reason}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Abandoned events and incomplete ticks",
      "description": "The P2-9 panel. An incomplete tick claimed entries, reported no failures and published nothing; A64-028.5A's soak logs hold 163 of them and nothing counted.",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(arena64_outbox_exhausted_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "exhausted {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "increase(arena64_outbox_incomplete_ticks_total[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "incomplete ticks",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (observation) (rate(arena64_outbox_unrecorded_attempts_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "claims {{observation}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate limiter",
      "description": "P1-7. While `unavailable` is non-zero the limiter is failing open and every rate limit on the platform is bypassed.",
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(arena64_rate_limit_decisions_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(arena64_rate_limit_unavailable_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "unavailable {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Analytics ingestion",
      "description": "A64-028.5A's P1-11 abandoned 1850 queue joins here, invisibly, because a rejected projection looked identical to a transient failure.",
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(arena64_analytics_events_ingested_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ingested {{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(arena64_analytics_events_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected {{reason}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Backup age",
      "description": "Published by the worker, which mounts the backup destination read-only \u2014 the backup container itself cannot answer a scrape. Absent means no backup has ever succeeded, which is a separate alert.",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - arena64_backup_last_success_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "since last success",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TLS certificate lifetime remaining",
      "description": "Read from the certificate on disk, not from the renewal job's exit status \u2014 a job that reports success and writes nothing produces no failure log and an expiring certificate. Absent means no certificate is readable, which is a separate alert.",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "arena64_certificate_expiry_timestamp_seconds - time()",
          "legendFormat": "time to expiry",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
